TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_4096cmBaseVioletLaserCannon=Research and develop the 4096cm Gigantic Base Violet Laser Cannon, an enormous energy weapon designed for maximum damage output against large targets such as capital ships and fortified structures. This colossal laser cannon will utilize advanced violet laser technology to deliver devastating firepower, making it a formidable asset in space combat scenarios where overwhelming force is required to secure victory.

