TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_LightIonBattery_RapidFire=Ion Batteries - Rapid Fire
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_LightIonBattery_RapidFire=Research and develop rapid-fire variants of ion batteries, designed to deliver a high volume of fire for enhanced defensive capabilities against fast-moving targets. These rapid-fire ion batteries will feature advanced ionization technology for increased damage output and improved performance against various threats.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_JitterStreamBattery_I=Jitter Stream Battery I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_JitterStreamBattery_I=Research and develop the Jitter Stream Battery I, a cutting-edge particle weapon that fires a stream of charged particles with a unique jittering pattern. This design allows the weapon to effectively disrupt enemy targeting systems and increase the likelihood of hitting agile targets, making it particularly effective against smaller, faster-moving targets such as missiles and fighter craft.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_JitterStreamBattery_II=Jitter Stream Battery II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_JitterStreamBattery_II=Research and develop the Jitter Stream Battery II, an upgraded version of the original Jitter Stream Battery, featuring enhanced particle acceleration technology and improved targeting systems. This iteration delivers a more concentrated and powerful stream of charged particles, increasing its effectiveness against a wider range of targets, including larger ships and fortified structures. The Jitter Stream Battery II's advanced targeting algorithms allow it to adapt its firing pattern in real-time, making it even more effective at tracking and engaging fast-moving targets. With its increased damage output and versatility, the Jitter Stream Battery II is a critical asset for any fleet looking to maintain superiority in space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_JitterStreamBattery_III=Jitter Stream Battery III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_JitterStreamBattery_III=Research and develop the Jitter Stream Battery III, representing the pinnacle of particle weapon technology, incorporating the latest advancements in particle acceleration and targeting systems. This version delivers an even more powerful and precise stream of charged particles, capable of inflicting devastating damage on a wide range of targets, from small fighter craft to heavily armored capital ships. The Jitter Stream Battery III's adaptive firing pattern allows it to effectively engage multiple targets simultaneously, making it an invaluable asset in large-scale space battles. With its unparalleled damage output and versatility, the Jitter Stream Battery III is a must-have weapon for any fleet seeking to dominate the battlefield and secure victory in space combat.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk1=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Prototype - Mk I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk1=Research and develop the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk I, an innovative energy weapon that fires high-velocity plasmoid projectiles. These projectiles are designed to streak through space at incredible speeds, delivering devastating damage upon impact. The Mk I version focuses on achieving a balance between firing rate and damage output, making it effective against a variety of targets, from small fighter craft to larger ships. With its unique plasmoid technology, the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk I is a formidable addition to any fleet's arsenal, providing enhanced offensive capabilities in space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk2=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Prototype - Mk II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk2=Research and develop the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk II, an upgraded version of the original Mk I, featuring enhanced plasmoid acceleration technology and improved targeting systems. The Mk II version delivers a more concentrated and powerful stream of high-velocity plasmoid projectiles, increasing its effectiveness against a wider range of targets, including larger ships and fortified structures. The Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk II's advanced targeting algorithms allow it to adapt its firing pattern in real-time,making it even more effective at tracking and engaging fast-moving targets. With its increased damage output and versatility, the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk II is a critical asset for any fleet looking to maintain superiority in space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk3=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Prototype - Mk III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk3=Research and develop the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk III, representing the pinnacle of plasmoid weapon technology, incorporating the latest advancements in plasmoid acceleration and targeting systems. The Mk III version delivers an even more powerful and precise stream of high-velocity plasmoid projectiles, capable of inflicting devastating damage on a wide range of targets, from small fighter craft to heavily armored capital ships. The Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk III's adaptive firing pattern allows it to effectively engage multiple targets simultaneously, making it an invaluable asset in large-scale space battles. With its unparalleled damage output and versatility, the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk III is a must-have weapon for any fleet seeking to dominate the battlefield and secure victory in space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk4=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Advanced Prototype - Mk IV
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk4=Research and develop the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk IV, an advanced iteration of the original Mk III, featuring cutting-edge advancements in plasmoid acceleration technology and targeting systems. The Mk IV version delivers an even more powerful and precise stream of high-velocity plasmoid projectiles, capable of inflicting devastating damage on a wide range of targets, from small fighter craft to heavily armored capital ships. The Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk IV's adaptive firing pattern allows it to effectively engage multiple targets simultaneously, making it an invaluable asset in large-scale space battles. With its unparalleled damage output and versatility, the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk IV is a must-have weapon for any fleet seeking to dominate the battlefield and secure victory in space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk5=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Advanced Prototype - Mk V
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk5=Research and develop the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk V, representing the pinnacle of plasmoid weapon technology, incorporating the latest advancements in plasmoid acceleration and targeting systems. The Mk V version delivers an even more powerful and precise stream of high-velocity plasmoid projectiles, capable of inflicting devastating damage on a wide range of targets, from small fighter craft to heavily armored capital ships. The Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk V's adaptive firing pattern allows it to effectively engage multiple targets simultaneously, making it an invaluable asset in large-scale space battles. With its unparalleled damage output and versatility, the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk V is a must-have weapon for any fleet seeking to dominate the battlefield and secure victory in space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk6=Plasmoid Streaker Battery Advanced Prototype - Mk VI
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PlasmoidStreakerBattery_Mk6=Research and develop the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk VI, representing the pinnacle of plasmoid weapon technology, incorporating the latest advancements in plasmoid acceleration and targeting systems. The Mk VI version delivers an even more powerful and precise stream of high-velocity plasmoid projectiles, capable of inflicting devastating damage on a wide range of targets, from small fighter craft to heavily armored capital ships. The Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk VI's adaptive firing pattern allows it to effectively engage multiple targets simultaneously, making it an invaluable asset in large-scale space battles. With its unparalleled damage output and versatility, the Plasmoid Streaker Battery Mk VI is a must-have weapon for any fleet seeking to dominate the battlefield and secure victory in space combat.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk1=Phased Plasma Cannon Prototype - Mk I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk1=Research and develop the Phased Plasma Cannon Mk I, an innovative energy weapon that fires high-velocity phased plasma projectiles. These projectiles are designed to streak through space at incredible speeds, delivering devastating damage upon impact. The Mk I version focuses on achieving a balance between firing rate and damage output, making it effective against a variety of targets, from small fighter craft to larger ships. With its unique phased plasma technology, the Phased Plasma Cannon Mk I is a formidable addition to any fleet's arsenal, providing enhanced offensive capabilities in space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk2=Phased Plasma Cannon Prototype - Mk II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk2=Research and develop the Phased Plasma Cannon Mk II, an upgraded version of the original Mk I, featuring enhanced phased plasma acceleration technology and improved targeting systems. The Mk II version delivers a more concentrated and powerful stream of high-velocity phased plasma projectiles, increasing its effectiveness against a wider range of targets, including larger ships and fortified structures. The Phased Plasma Cannon Mk II's advanced targeting algorithms allow it to adapt its firing pattern in real-time, making it even more effective at tracking and engaging fast-moving targets. With its increased damage output and versatility, the Phased Plasma Cannon Mk II is a critical asset for any fleet looking to maintain superiority in space combat.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk3=Phased Plasma Cannon Prototype - Mk III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_PhasedPlasmaCannon_Mk3=Research and develop the Phased Plasma Cannon Mk III, representing the pinnacle of phased plasma weapon technology, incorporating the latest advancements in phased plasma acceleration and targeting systems. The Mk III version delivers an even more powerful and precise stream of high-velocity phased plasma projectiles, capable of inflicting devastating damage on a wide range of targets, from small fighter craft to heavily armored capital ships. The Phased Plasma Cannon Mk III's adaptive firing pattern allows it to effectively engage multiple targets simultaneously, making it an invaluable asset in large-scale space battles. With its unparalleled damage output and versatility, the Phased Plasma Cannon Mk III is a must-have weapon for any fleet seeking to dominate the battlefield and secure victory in space combat.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk1=Prototype Plasma Array Mk I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk1=Research and develop the Prototype Plasma Array Mk I, a cutting-edge energy production facility that harnesses the power of controlled singularities to generate immense amounts of energy. This advanced reactor farm provides a stable and efficient energy source, capable of supporting large-scale space operations and powering the most demanding technological advancements. The Prototype Plasma Array Mk I's innovative design ensures maximum energy output while maintaining safety and stability, making it an essential asset for any fleet or colony seeking to achieve energy dominance and technological superiority in space.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk2=Prototype Plasma Array Mk II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk2=Research and develop the Prototype Plasma Array Mk II, an upgraded version of the original Mk I, featuring enhanced singularity control technology and improved energy conversion systems. The Mk II version delivers even greater energy output and efficiency, making it an invaluable asset for supporting large-scale space operations and powering the most demanding technological advancements. The Prototype Plasma Array Mk II's innovative design ensures maximum energy output while maintaining safety and stability, making it an essential asset for any fleet or colony seeking to achieve energy dominance and technological superiority in space.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk3=Prototype Plasma Array Mk III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk3=Research and develop the Prototype Plasma Array Mk III, representing the pinnacle of singularity-based energy production technology, incorporating the latest advancements in singularity control and energy conversion systems. The Mk III version delivers unparalleled energy output and efficiency, making it an invaluable asset for supporting large-scale space operations and powering the most demanding technological advancements. The Prototype Plasma Array Mk III's innovative design ensures maximum energy output while maintaining safety and stability, making it an essential asset for any fleet or colony seeking to achieve energy dominance and technological superiority in space.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk4=Prototype Plasma Array Mk IV
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ProtoPlasmaArray_Mk4=Research and develop the Prototype Plasma Array Mk IV, an advanced iteration of the original Mk III, featuring cutting-edge advancements in singularity control technology and energy conversion systems. The Mk IV version delivers even greater energy output and efficiency, making it an invaluable asset for supporting large-scale space operations and powering the most demanding technological advancements. The Prototype Plasma Array Mk IV's innovative design ensures maximum energy output while maintaining safety and stability, making it an essential asset for any fleet or colony seeking to achieve energy dominance and technological superiority in space.
